668e0024b0814d9181768736da410902,8991236a1afc41928d5e2e144f0e2a43,baevski2020wav2vec20,c_x42mgo,ai,True,False,True,baevski2020wav2vec2,baevski2020wav2vec2,True,Supported,Supported,True,high,0.99,background,background,True,False,False,False,False,1,2,1.0,1.0,"Although self-supervised and weakly supervised pretraining has improved general ASR performance (e.g., wav2vec~2.0~ and Whisper~), domain mismatch remains a major source of error, motivating the need for recent, domain-specific speech resources.","Although self-supervised and weakly supervised pretraining has improved general ASR performance (e.g., wav2vec~2.0~ and Whisper~), domain mismatch remains a major source of error, motivating the need for recent, domain-specific speech resources.",True,The cited work is an example of self-supervised or weakly supervised pretraining that has improved general ASR performance.,,"wav2vec 2.0: A Framework for Self-Supervised Learning of Speech Representations {abaevski,henryzhou7,abdo,michaelauli}@fb.com Facebook AI Abstract We show for the first time that learning powerful representations from speech audio alone followed by fine-tuning on transcribed speech can outperform the best semi-supervised methods while being conceptually simpler. wav2vec 2.0 masks the speech input in the latent space and solves a contrastive task defined over a quantization of the latent representations which are jointly learned.","wav2vec 2.0: A Framework for Self-Supervised
Learning of Speech Representations
{abaevski,henryzhou7,abdo,michaelauli}@fb.com
Facebook AI
Abstract
We show for the ﬁrst time that learning powerful representations from speech
audio alone followed by ﬁne-tuning on transcribed speech can outperform the best
semi-supervised methods while being conceptually simpler. wav2vec 2.0 masks
the speech input in the latent space and solves a contrastive task deﬁned over a
quantization of the latent representations which are jointly learned. ||| We report the average WER and standard deviation on
the concatenation of dev-clean and dev-other (dev PER) for three seeds of ﬁne-tuning.
6
Conclusion
We presented wav2vec 2.0, a framework for self-supervised learning of speech representations which
masks latent representations of the raw waveform and solves a contrastive task over quantized speech
representations."
